      "hasMediaInOriginal": true,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "🏆 O‘zbekiston Maltadagi Global Startup Awards finalida ikkita global g‘oliblikni qo‘lga kiritdi\n\nMaltada bo‘lib o‘tgan Global Startup Awards Grand Finale (EU-Startups Summit doirasida) dunyoning eng yaxshi innovatsion loyihalarini e’lon qildi. Jami 14 ta global nominatsiya ichida O‘zbekiston vakillari birdaniga ikki yo‘nalishda g‘olib bo‘lib, ekotizimimizning xalqaro darajadagi raqobatbardoshligini isbotlashdi. \n\n🥇 Ekspertlar baholashi va hamjamiyat ovoz berish natijalariga ko‘ra quyidagilar g‘olib deb topildi:\n\nCatextra — Yilning eng yaxshi global Greentech startapi\n\nRaximaxon Nugmanova — People’s Choice nominatsiyasi g‘olibi\n\nMazkur global muvaffaqiyat 2025-yil sentyabr oyida O‘zbekistonda ICT WEEK doirasida IT Park Uzbekistan qo‘llab-quvvatlovi bilan o‘tkazilgan Hududiy finalning mantiqiy davomidir. Aynan Toshkentdagi bosqich asoschilarimiz uchun Malta sahnasida o‘z salohiyatlarini namoyish etishga mustahkam poydevor bo‘ldi. 🌏\n\nUshbu natijalar mahalliy loyihalarning masshtablashuv imkoniyatlarini tasdiqlaydi va O‘zbekiston startap ekotizimining xalqaro integratsiyaga tayyorligini ko‘rsatadi. Bunday e’tirof global investorlar va hamkorlar uchun mintaqa texnologik bozoridagi imkoniyatlarni belgilab beruvchi strategik ko‘rsatkich bo‘lib xizmat qiladi.\n\nCatextra jamoasini va Raximaxon Nugmanovani ushbu tarixiy natija bilan tabriklaymiz. 🎉\n\nEkotizimimiz kelajagi — global miqyosda 🚀\n\n—\n\n🏆 Uzbekistan secures two global wins at the Global Startup Awards in Malta\n\nThe Global Startup Awards Grand Finale, held during the EU-Startups Summit in Malta, has announced the world's top innovators. Out of 14 global categories, representatives from Uzbekistan claimed victories in two major nominations, proving the international competitiveness of our growing ecosystem.\n\n🥇 Based on expert evaluation and community voting, the global winners are:\n\nCatextra — Best Greentech Startup of the Year\n\nRakhimakhon Nugmanova — People’s Choice Award Winner\n\nThis global success follows the Regional Finale held in Uzbekistan in September 2025 as part of ICT WEEK, supported by IT Park Uzbekistan. The regional stage set the momentum for our founders to showcase their potential before taking over the world stage in Malta. 🌏\n\nThese results validate the scalability of local solutions and indicate an increasing readiness of the Uzbek startup ecosystem for international integration. Such recognition acts as a strategic indicator for global investors and partners, highlighting the emerging opportunities within the region’s technology market.\n\nCongratulations to the Catextra team and Rakhimakhon Nugmanova on this historic achievement. 🎉\n\nThe future of our ecosystem is global 🚀\n\nTelegram | Facebook | Instagram | Youtube | LinkedIn | X",
